m_assets/steam/apps/2847850/extras/a41edd81f6c007478e6955af46acc5c0.webm?t=1744580404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847850/extras/a41edd81f6c007478e6955af46acc5c0.mp4?t=1744580404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Parcour skills<br></li><li> Build challenging levels with your friends<br></li><li> Huge selection of blocks to create a variety of levels<br></li><li> Variety of levels with different challenges<br></li><li> Host or join a game via Steam with upto 6 players (hard limit is 32 players - but it is optimized for upto 6 players)<br></li><li> Ingame communication: Voice chat / chat</li></ul>",
